  \oobeWelcome\LaunchNarratorInstruction:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: To set up your device using a screen reader, turn on Narrator by pressing Windows + Control + Enter. For more accessibility features, press Windows + U, or select the Accessibility icon in the bottom corner.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro5VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Ok, enough intro. Let’s dig in.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro4VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: If you need an assistive screen reader, press the Windows, Control, and Enter keys at the same time to turn on Narrator.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro3VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Use your voice or the keyboard along the way, and if you’d like me to stay quiet, just select the little microphone icon towards the bottom of your screen.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro2VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: A little sign-in here, a touch of Wi-Fi there, and we’ll have your PC ready for all you plan to do.
  \oobeWelcome\Intro1VoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Hi there! I’m Cortana, and I’m here to help.
  \oobeWelcome\CortanaAnimationAccString:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Cortana ᎦᏬᏂᏍᎬᎢ
  \oobeUpdateSettings\UpdateSettingsTitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Stay secure with updates
  \oobeUpdateSettings\UpdateSettingsSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Regular updates keep your device running smoothly and securely, plus bring you new features to help you stay more productive across devices. Choose your update settings, then select Accept to save them. You can change your settings at any time.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\SettingNarratorDescriptionFormatString:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: %1 ᎠᏟᏲᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ %2.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᎩᏍᏗ
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᎤᎪᏗ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreHeader3:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: How to change update settings for Microsoft Store apps
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreHeader2:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: How to change update settings for Windows Update
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreHeader1:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Automatic updates for Windows and Microsoft Store apps
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreDescription:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Select ‘Learn more’ for info on the above settings.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎤᎪᏗ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreBody3:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: You can change your update settings at any time by visiting Microsoft Store > See more > Settings.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreBody2:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: You can change your update settings at any time by visiting Settings > Update & Security > Windows Update > Advanced options.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\LearnMoreBody1:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Regular updates help protect your device and keep it running smoothly and securely. If you choose to get automatic updates, they’ll download to your device as soon as they’re available so you always have the latest security fixes and enhancements, like Windows Defender, driver, and firmware updates. If you choose not to get automatic updates, Microsoft will still check your device for available updates. We’ll notify you periodically when new updates are available. You can then choose whether or not to download the updates, but you won’t be fully up to date and protected until you download and install them.
  \oobeUpdateSettings\CustomizeVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Regular updates help keep your device running smoothly. Choose if you want to get automatic Windows and Microsoft Store app updates, and then select "Accept."
  \oobeUpdateSettings\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏂᎬᎯᎯᎵᏎᏍᏗ
  \oobeSettings\SettingsTitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎭᏑᏯᎩ ᎤᏕᎵᏓ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎩ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ
  \oobeSettings\SettingsSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Microsoft puts you in control of your privacy. Choose your settings, then select <b>Accept</b> to save them. You can change these settings at any time.
  \oobeSettings\SettingNarratorDescriptionFormatString:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: %1 ᎠᏟᏲᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᎿᎢ %2.
  \oobeSettings\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏐᎢ
  \oobeSettings\NextButtonAccLabel:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Next, tab through all privacy settings to continue
  \oobeSettings\NavigationError:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᎦᏓ ᏕᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᏂᎬᏩᏍᏓ - ᎡᎵᏊᏃ Ꮭ ᎫᏓᎸᏅ ᏱᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᏃ ᏓᏓᎴᎦ ᎠᏯᏗᏟ ᏃᎬᏅᎩ. ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎪᏪᎸ ᏱᎪᎵᏯ Microsoft Privacy Statement ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᎲᏫᏳ ᏱᏕᎭᏍᏐᎥᏍᏓ aka.ms/privacy ᎾᎾᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᏩᏎᏍᏗ ᎦᎾᎸ Ꮎ ᏂᎦᎥ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏂᎦᎥ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.
  \oobeSettings\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᎤᎪᏗ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ
  \oobeSettings\LearnMoreDescription:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Select <b>Learn more</b> for info on the above settings, how Windows helps protect you from unsafe apps and web content, and the related data transfers and uses.
  \oobeSettings\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎤᎪᏗ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ 
  \oobeSettings\CustomizeVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᎠᏃ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ Microsoft ᏗᎧᏁᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ. ᎠᎴ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏘᎪᎵᏯᏊ, ᎠᎴ ᏱᏣᏑᏰᏏ "Accept" ᎾᎯᏳᎢ ᏣᏛᏅᎢᏍᏔᏅᎢ ᎨᏎᏍᏗ.
  \oobeSettings\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏂᎬᎯᎵᏎᏍᏗ
  \oobeSettings\AcceptButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᎩᏍᏗ
  \oobeSettings\AcceptButtonAccLabel:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Accept all privacy settings
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\TelemetryVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Next, choose whether or not you want to help Microsoft diagnose and fix issues.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\TailoredVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: If you want tips, offers, and suggestions that are tailored to you, just select Accept.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\SettingsTitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎭᏑᏯᎩ ᎤᏕᎵᏓ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎩ ᎾᏍᎩᎾ ᏣᏤᎵ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏗᏗᏂᎸᏨᎢ
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\NavigationError:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎢᎦᏓ ᏕᎫᏓᎸᎢ ᏓᏓᎴᎬᎢ ᏂᎬᏩᏍᏓ - ᎡᎵᏊᏃ Ꮭ ᎫᏓᎸᏅ ᏱᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ, ᎠᎴ ᎾᏍᎩᎾᏃ ᏓᏓᎴᎦ ᎠᏯᏗᏟ ᏃᎬᏅᎩ. ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏂᎦᏓ ᎪᏪᎸ ᏱᎪᎵᏯ Microsoft Privacy Statement ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᎲᏫᏳ ᏱᏕᎭᏍᏐᎥᏍᏓ aka.ms/privacy ᎾᎾᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᏩᏎᏍᏗ ᎦᎾᎸ Ꮎ ᏂᎦᎥ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᎩ ᎤᎾᎢ ᏂᎦᎥ ᏥᏂᎬᏅᏗᏓᎾ.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\MultiSettingsSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Choose your settings, then select <b>Accept</b> to save them. Check the <b>Learn more</b> link for info on these settings, how to change them, how Windows helps protect you from unsafe apps and web content, and the related data transfers and uses.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\LocationVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Now, choose if you want to let Microsoft and other apps use your location to help you with directions, weather, and more.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ ᎤᎪᏗ ᏄᏍᏛᎢ ᎯᎠ ᏕᎦᎧᎲᎢ
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎤᎪᏗ ᎠᏕᎶᏆᏍᏗ
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\InputDiagnosticsVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: And if you want to help improve language recognition and suggestions for apps and services that run on Windows, you can choose to do that here.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\FindMyDeviceVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: And if you ever lose your device, here's where you get to choose if you want help finding it.
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏂᎬᎯᎯᎵᏎᏍᏗ
  \oobeSettingsMultiPage\AdsVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Last up for these settings, choose whether or not you want your ads to be more relevant to you.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\Title:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Required data collection
  \oobeSettingsAadc\Subtitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Your privacy is important, which is why we want you to understand the data we collect.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubText2:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Microsoft strives to provide the best possible protection from digital threats. To help achieve this, Microsoft Defender SmartScreen and Smart App Control collect info about websites you visit, files you download, and apps you install and run. This data is used to warn you and help protect you, your device, and your passwords from unsafe apps and web content.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubText1:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Microsoft collects info about your device, its settings and capabilities, and whether it’s performing properly. Required diagnostic data is the minimum level of diagnostic data needed to help keep your device reliable, secure, operating normally, and to make related improvements to Windows.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubHeader2:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Protection from unsafe apps and web content
  \oobeSettingsAadc\SubHeader1:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Required diagnostic data
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcTitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Required data collection
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcNextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Next
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcLearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Learn More
  \oobeSettingsAadc\OobeSettingsAadcBodyText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Microsoft collects required data to keep your device up to date, secure, and working properly. This might include info about your files, app settings, and info used to help fix problems.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\NextButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Next
  \oobeSettingsAadc\NavigationError:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: It looks like we are having some connectivity issues - you may not be connected to the internet, or there is an issue on our end. You can read more about Required diagnostic data by typing https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2162067 into the address bar of any browser on any device.
  \oobeSettingsAadc\LearnMoreTitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Learn more about required data collection
  \oobeSettingsAadc\LearnMoreButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Learn more
  \oobeSettingsAadc\ContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Continue
  \oobeRetailDemoExit\confirmTitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏂᎯᏃ ᎾᎥᏊ ᎤᏓᎷᎳ ᎤᎴᏫᏍᏙᏗᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ  ᎠᏓᎾᏅᏗ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎤᎦᏙᎲᏒᎢ
  \oobeRetailDemoExit\confirmSecondayCommandText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏎᎯᏍᏗ
  \oobeRetailDemoExit\confirmPrimaryCommandText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎪᎯᏳᏙᏗ
  \oobeRetailDemoExit\confirmContent:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎯᎠ ᏱᏕᎦᏅᎦᎳ ᏂᎦᎥ ᎦᎸᏛᎢ. ᎡᎵᏊ ᎢᏳᎵᏍᏙᏗ ᏱᏂᏨᏁᎳ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᏓᎾᏅᏗ ᎦᎾᏗᏅᏗ ᎬᏂᎨᏒ ᏱᎬᏁᎯ ᎤᎦᏙᎲᏒ ᏏᏊᏃ Ꮭ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ ᏱᎦᎸᏕᏍᏗ ᎩᎳ ᏂᎯ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎾᎾᎢ ᎠᏏᎳᏕᏫᏒᎢ ᎱᏓᎸᏅᎢ.
  \oobeRetailDemoEntry\confirmTitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎭᎴᏃ ᏰᎵᎢ ᏂᏍᏚᎢᎭ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎵᎢᏙᏗ ᎬᏂᎨᏄᎢ ᏱᎬᏁᏗ ᎠᏁᏟᏙᏗ
  \oobeRetailDemoEntry\confirmSecondayCommandText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎠᏎᏒᏗ
  \oobeRetailDemoEntry\confirmPrimaryCommandText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎪᎯᏳᏙᏗ
  \oobeRetailDemoEntry\confirmedTitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏣᏍᏚᎢ ᎾᏍᎩ ᎠᎵᎢᏗᏍᎩ ᎬᏂᎨᏒᎢ ᏱᎬᏁᏗᎢ ᎠᏁᏟᏙᏗ
  \oobeRetailDemoEntry\confirmedPrimaryCommandText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏂᎬᎯᎯᎵᏎᏍᏗ
  \oobeRetailDemoEntry\confirmedContent:
