  \oobeHello\HelloLearnMoreNavigationError:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: It looks like we are having some connectivity issues - you may not be connected to the internet, or there is an issue on our end. You can read the full Microsoft Privacy Statement anytime by typing aka.ms/privacy into the address bar of any browser on any device.
  \oobeHello\HelloLearnMoreLinkText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Learn more about account protection
  \oobeHello\HelloLeadTextFingerprint:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏣᏤᎵᎢ ᎪᎷᏩᏘᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏂᎤᏍᏗ ᎥᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᏚᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎠᏕᎶᎰᎯᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᎾᏍᎩ ᏚᏂᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᎰᎢ Windows Hello, ᎾᏍᎩ ᏣᏁᎲᎢ ᏩᎯᏗᏴᎢ, ᎧᏁᎬᎢ ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏗᏍᎩ-ᏄᏍᏛᎾ ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎪᎯᏗᏍᎩ ᏂᎯ ᏣᏃᎮᏍᎩ.
  \oobeHello\HelloLeadTextFace:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏣᏤᎵ ᏗᏓᏟᎶᏍᏗᏍᎩ ᏚᎸᏫᏍᏓᏁᏲ Windows Hello ᎤᏠᏯᏍᏗ Ꮎ ᎠᏓᏙᎵᎩ, ᎰᎵᎩ, ᏄᏦᏍᏛᎾ ᎠᏓᏁᎰᎢ, ᎠᏍᏚᎢᏍᏙᏗ ᎥᎧᏁᎬᎢ-ᎾᏚᏓᎸᎾ ᏂᎦᎵᏍᏗᏍᎬ ᎣᏏ ᎠᏰᎸᏅᎩ ᏣᏤᎵ ᎠᏓᏙᏟᏍᏙᏗ.
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Use Windows Hello to unlock your PC with just your fingerprint. It's not only faster, it's more secure than a password. Want to set that up now?
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintIconAriaLabel:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows Hello ᎦᏰᏌᏛᎢᎤᏙᏪᎸᎢ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ
  \oobeHello\HelloFingerprintEnrollmentVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Follow the instructions to teach your PC to read your fingerprints
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Use Windows Hello to unlock your PC, quick as a wink, with just your face. No wink required. Want to set that up now?
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceIconAriaLabel:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows Hello ᎤᎧᏛᎢ ᎠᎢᎧᏂ
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceEnrollmentVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Ok, hold still for a second. We need to learn to recognize you
  \oobeHello\HelloFaceAnimationAltText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Windows Hello ᎤᎧᏛᎢ ᏗᏟᎶᏍᏔᏅ ᎠᏓᏅᏏᏙᎯ
  \oobeHello\HelloContinueButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Continue
  \oobeHello\HelloButtonText:
