  \oobeHello\GoToSettingsBioDataSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Take me to settings where I can remove sign-in options and delete my data.​
  \oobeHello\BioConsentTitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Choose if you want to keep signing in with your face or fingerprint
  \oobeHello\BioConsentSubtitle:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Do you want to keep storing your face or fingerprint data on this PC?
  \oobeHello\BioConsentListAccessibleName:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: Keep using your sign in options
  \oobeHello\AllSetText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: That’s it, you’re all set!
  \oobeEula\YesButtonText:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏗᏗᏂᎸᏨᎢ
  \oobeEula\PageVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CHR-CHER-US: ᏔᎵᏁ ᎦᎪᏗ: ᎾᏍᎩ ᏗᎧᏃᏩᏛᏍᏗ ᎪᎱᏍᏗ. ᏍᏆᎳᎢ, ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᎠᏎᎢ ᏣᏑᏰᏍᏗ "Accept" ᎾᏍᎩ ᎬᏙᏗ Windows. (ᎾᏍᎩᏃ ᏯᏎᏏ, ᎠᏎᏃ ᎾᎯᏳ, ᏣᏂᏔ, ᎧᏂᎩᏓ Windows.)
  \oobeEula\OEMIFrameLabel:
